### One point of a log scan (lead_energy_scan_def.mac, lead_thick_scan_def.mac): leadScanEvents
### muons of leadScanE GeV, normalised to the band leadScanE / leadScanHalfStep - leadScanE x
### leadScanHalfStep, half a grid step on each side (10^(1.5/19) = 1.19935 for 20 points from 0.1
### to 100 GeV, 10^(2/59) = 1.08118 for 60 from 0.01 to 100 GeV)

/control/divide leadScanLow {leadScanE} {leadScanHalfStep}
/control/multiply leadScanHigh {leadScanE} {leadScanHalfStep}
/tof/cosmic/energyMin {leadScanLow} GeV
/tof/cosmic/energyMax {leadScanHigh} GeV
/tof/cosmic/monoEnergy {leadScanE} GeV
/OutputFile leadscan_t{leadT}_E{leadScanE}
/run/beamOn {leadScanEvents}
